WEBVTT

00:07:58.716 --> 00:08:00.696
Da li možda postoji red

00:08:00.696 --> 00:08:03.700
u haosu koji sam stvorio?

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.440
Hajde da malo bliže pogledamo.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:07.366
Da li se sećate kada sam vam

00:08:07.366 --> 00:08:10.022
pokazao delove slagalice?

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:12.238
Šta je ta slika na kraju postala?

00:08:12.529 --> 00:08:14.749
Kobaltno plavi konj.

00:08:14.749 --> 00:08:16.969
Klupko se mrsi.

00:08:16.969 --> 00:08:19.190
I igrali smo tangram

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:22.572
sa smaragdno zelenim petlom.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:26.378
Ta mi je omiljena.

00:08:26.378 --> 00:08:29.363
A onda smo imali eksperiment

00:08:29.363 --> 00:08:32.348
sa srebrnim volom.